# Leave VITE_API_BASE_URL unset — client.js already figures out the right
# API host at runtime (same host the dashboard was loaded from, port 8000),
# which is what makes it work both from this Mac AND from a phone on the
# same network without editing anything here. Only set this if the backend
# is deployed on a genuinely different host/port than the dashboard (e.g. a
# real server with a fixed domain), for example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://access.aiu.edu:8000
